  "instance_name": "frankenstein_monster",
  "label": "Frankenstein's Monster",
  "description": "Frankenstein's monster is a fictional character from Mary Shelley's 1818 novel 'Frankenstein,' often portrayed as a grotesque, stitched-together creature. The meme uses this character as a visual metaphor for something 'unnatural' or 'monstrous,' which is applied to Bruce Jenner to demean his transition. This requires knowledge of the character's cultural representation as a symbol of horror and abnormality.",
